From dc0c695b76adfb91986d8f0c4a8327fa20610991 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dj <43033058+DjDeveloperr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:34:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] firmware: Add the shared T6050 APIF platform base

Provide the APIF MMIO transport, DART/SART ownership backends, T6050 CPU identification, shared RTKit/mailbox support, and common consumer interfaces on Linux 7.3. The native platform drivers continue to use their existing paths. Shared headers, build declarations, documentation, and host-test support let the remaining driver changes be reviewed as sibling PRs.

Source snapshot: t6050-gpu ee68abb105200e99636a5edfc647a5cfc1d89954
Integration base: 9cbdd0734d9e186c5f5f5949a21b909d10c2571b

Signed-off-by: Dj <43033058+DjDeveloperr@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit d9d9ee64e7d81211402377dc18d6bcb9a8f28177)
---
